{# =========================================================
   RoomHive — My Bookings (renter + host)
   templates/user/bookings.html.twig

   Status-tab bookings list on the shared account shell (navbar +
   sidebar partial + footer). Sidebar highlight key: 'bookings'.

   NAVBAR CLEARANCE + LAYOUT — page-local, bulletproof (same fix as
   the notifications page): plain .up-dashboard rules can lose to
   myaccount.css and a top margin can collapse away — which let the
   sidebar box slide under the fixed navbar (toggle + Overview link
   hidden). So the shell overrides live on main.up-dashboard (higher
   specificity, always wins) and the clearance is PADDING, which can
   never collapse: sidebar top = 110px, card top = 185px, shell
   max-width 1560px. .up-dashboard .up-sidebar { top: 110px; } keeps
   the sticky offset clear of the navbar while scrolling.

   ROW LAYOUT + IMAGE FIX (this version, page-local, bulletproof):
   two visible bugs on the live page —
     1. THUMB always showed the grey house-icon placeholder: the
        controller never supplied cover / cover_url. BookingsController
        now pulls the listing cover (same subselect as
        HostBookingsController) and resolves it through the shared
        resolvePhoto() mapping — the <img> renders whenever the
        listing has a photo, placeholder stays as the fallback.
     2. The right meta column (status pill · price · "Reserve Paid" ·
        "₱n left" pill) hugged the card edge, "Reserve Paid" rendered
        LARGE (a generic span rule leaked in), and the chevron
        overlapped the pills. The whole row is now defined HERE on
        main.up-dashboard specificity so myaccount.css can never
        interfere:
          - .up-booking-row   → flex, items centered, gap 16, border +
                                radius, color/text-decoration inherit;
          - .up-booking-info  → flex: 1 + min-width: 0 (title
                                ellipsizes instead of pushing the row);
          - .up-booking-side  → own column, right-aligned, margin-left:
                                auto, padding-right 24px so the
                                absolutely-centred chevron never overlaps;
          - price <strong>    → 15px/800 ink (the prominent figure);
          - bare label spans  → 12px muted (Reserve Paid / Fully Paid /
                                Booking Total / Refunded to Wallet) —
                                :not() chain keeps the status pill and
                                the colored note pills untouched;
          - .up-booking-chevron → absolute, right 14px, vertically
                                centered, muted.
        Dark-mode variants included (same mechanism as the payments
        page). The old margin-left band-aid on .up-booking-info is
        gone — the flex gap owns the thumb↔text spacing now.

   CANCEL BOOKING (this version): every PENDING row now carries a
   small red "Cancel" pill at the foot of the right meta column.
   Click → JS confirm (same wording as the details page's cancel
   form) → a hidden form POSTs /booking/cancel-booking
   (BookingCancelController — already live) → 98% of what was paid
   is credited to the wallet, the host is notified, and the PRG
   redirect lands on /booking/{id}?review=1 where the "rate your
   stay" overlay pops. The button is type=button INSIDE the row <a>,
   so its handler calls preventDefault + stopPropagation to keep
   the link from firing, then disables itself against double
   submits. Only pending rows render it — the controller bounces
   every other status, so nothing else would work anyway.

   Data from BookingsController (bookings, bookings_total, tabs,
   status_counts, status_filter, is_host, nav_avatar,
   notification_count). NO CONTROLLER CHANGE IS NEEDED for this —
   BookingsController.php already ships b.status in every row.
========================================================= #}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
        <title>My Bookings · RoomHive</title>

        <script>
            /* theme boot — before paint */
            (function () {
                try {
                    if (localStorage.getItem("roomhive_theme") === "dark") {
                        document.documentElement.classList.add("dark");
                        document.documentElement.setAttribute("data-theme", "dark");
                    }
                } catch (e) {}
            })();
            document.documentElement.classList.add("js");
        </script>

        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/style.css') }}">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('assets/myaccount.css') }}">

        <style>
            :root {
                --rh-ink: #1c2a38;
                --rh-muted: #66788a;
                --rh-line: #e6ebf1;
                --rh-card: #ffffff;
                --rh-accent: #eda423;
                --rh-radius: 16px;
            }

            /* =========================================================
                                       NAVBAR CLEARANCE + LAYOUT — page-local, bulletproof
                                       Same fix as the notifications page: plain .up-dashboard
                                       rules can lose to myaccount.css and a top margin can
                                       collapse away — which let the sidebar box slide under
                                       the fixed navbar (toggle + Overview link hidden). So:
                                         - main.up-dashboard (higher specificity) always wins;
                                         - the clearance is PADDING — margins can collapse,
                                           padding can never — sidebar top = 110px, card top
                                           = 185px, the same geometry as the other pages;
                                         - max-width: 1560px — occupies the available area
                                           instead of the legacy ~1240px cap.
                                    ========================================================== */
            main.up-dashboard {
                margin-top: 0;
                padding: 110px 20px 70px;
                max-width: 1560px;
            }

            /* the MIDDLE COLUMN (bookings card) keeps its extra 75px
                                       drop below the shell's 110px clearance */
            .up-dashboard .up-content {
                padding-top: 75px;
            }

            /* sticky offset matches the natural top — when you scroll,
                                       the sidebar sticks at the same 110px line instead of
                                       tucking under the navbar (the partial's default is 86px) */
            .up-dashboard .up-sidebar {
                top: 110px;
            }

            .nav-bell svg {
                width: 22px;
                height: 22px;
                display: block;
            }

            /* Lucide calendar in booking rows */
            .up-booking-dates {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 5px;
            }
            .up-booking-dates svg {
                width: 13px;
                height: 13px;
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }

            /* thumb with placeholder behind (works with or without a photo) */
            .up-thumb-wrap {
                position: relative;
                overflow: hidden;
                flex-shrink: 0;
                width: 92px;
                height: 68px;
                border-radius: 10px;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dfe6ee, #c9d4e0);
                color: #93a5b7;
            }
            .up-thumb-wrap svg {
                width: 20px;
                height: 20px;
            }
            .up-thumb-wrap img {
                position: absolute;
                inset: 0;
                width: 100%;
                height: 100%;
                object-fit: cover;
            }

            .up-bookings-empty svg {
                width: 34px;
                height: 34px;
                margin-bottom: 6px;
                color: #93a5b7;
            }

            /* RESERVE PAYMENT NOTE — "₱200.00 left" pill */
            .up-booking-side .ub-left-note {
                font-size: 11px;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: #c77800;
                background: #fff6e9;
                border: 1px dashed #f5c77e;
                border-radius: 999px;
                padding: 2px 9px;
                white-space: nowrap;
            }

            /* REFUND PILL + green amount */
            .up-booking-side .ub-refund-note {
                font-size: 11px;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: #1e7a3d;
                background: #e9f7ef;
                border: 1px dashed #bfe8cf;
                border-radius: 999px;
                padding: 2px 9px;
                white-space: nowrap;
            }
            .up-booking-side strong.ub-refund-amount {
                color: #1e7a3d;
            }

            .up-status-rejected {
                background: #fdecea;
                color: #a1332e;
            }

            /* CANCEL BOOKING — small red pill at the foot of the right
               meta column, pending rows only. Outline at rest, filled
               on hover — same red family as the status-rejected pill. */
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .ub-cancel-btn {
                appearance: none;
                margin-top: 6px;
                border: 1px solid #e3b7ae;
                background: #ffffff;
                color: #a1332e;
                font-size: 11px;
                font-weight: 800;
                letter-spacing: 0.02em;
                border-radius: 999px;
                padding: 3px 12px;
                cursor: pointer;
                transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease,
                    border-color 0.15s ease;
            }
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .ub-cancel-btn:hover {
                background: #a1332e;
                border-color: #a1332e;
                color: #ffffff;
            }
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .ub-cancel-btn:active {
                transform: translateY(1px);
            }

            /* =========================================================
                                       ROW LAYOUT — page-local, bulletproof.
                                       thumb · info (grows, ellipsizes) · right meta column ·
                                       absolute chevron — fully defined here so myaccount.css
                                       and generic `a` rules can never interfere.
                                    ========================================================== */
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-row {
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 16px;
                position: relative;
                padding: 16px 18px;
                border: 1px solid var(--rh-line);
                border-radius: 12px;
                color: inherit;
                text-decoration: none;
                transition: background 0.15s ease;
            }
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-row:hover {
                background: #f6f8fb;
            }
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-row + .up-booking-row {
                margin-top: 12px;
            }

            /* thumb — pinned box; photo covers it, icon shows behind */
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-thumb.up-thumb-wrap {
                width: 92px;
                height: 68px;
            }

            /* info column — grows, never pushes the row wide */
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-info {
                flex: 1 1 auto;
                min-width: 0;
            }
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-info h4 {
                margin: 0 0 3px;
                font-size: 15px;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                white-space: nowrap;
                overflow: hidden;
                text-overflow: ellipsis;
            }
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-location {
                margin: 0 0 4px;
                font-size: 12.5px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-dates {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 12px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
            }

            /* right meta column — right-aligned, clear of the chevron */
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-side {
                margin-left: auto;
                flex-shrink: 0;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-end;
                gap: 4px;
                text-align: right;
                padding-right: 24px;
            }
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-side strong {
                font-size: 15px;
                font-weight: 800;
                color: var(--rh-ink);
                white-space: nowrap;
            }
            /* pay-state label — "Reserve Paid" / "Fully Paid" / "Booking
               Total" / "Refunded to Wallet": small muted line. The :not()
               chain keeps the status pill + colored note pills out. */
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-side > span:not(.up-status):not(.ub-left-note):not(.ub-refund-note) {
                font-size: 12px;
                color: var(--rh-muted);
                text-decoration: none;
                white-space: nowrap;
            }

            /* chevron — vertically centered, never overlapping the pills */
            main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-chevron {
                position: absolute;
                right: 14px;
                top: 50%;
                transform: translateY(-50%);
                font-size: 22px;
                line-height: 1;
                color: #93a5b7;
            }

            /* narrow screens — let the row wrap instead of overflowing */
            @media (max-width: 620px) {
                main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-row {
                    flex-wrap: wrap;
                }
                main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-side {
                    padding-right: 0;
                }
            }

            /* dark mode — same mechanism as the payments page */
            html.dark main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-row {
                border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
            }
            html.dark main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-row:hover {
                background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            }
            html.dark main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-info h4,
            html.dark main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-side strong {
                color: #e8eef5;
            }
            html.dark main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-location,
            html.dark main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-dates,
            html.dark main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-side > span:not(.up-status):not(.ub-left-note):not(.ub-refund-note) {
                color: #a9b8c8;
            }
            html.dark main.up-dashboard .ub-list .up-booking-chevron {
                color: #5f7488;
            }

            /* dark mode: cancel pill */
            html.dark main.up-dashboard .ub-list .ub-cancel-btn {
                background: transparent;
                border-color: rgba(224, 141, 132, 0.45);
                color: #e08d84;
            }
            html.dark main.up-dashboard .ub-list .ub-cancel-btn:hover {
                background: #a1332e;
                border-color: #a1332e;
                color: #ffffff;
            }

            /* dark mode: tab pill + thumbs */
            html.dark .ub-tab.active {
                background: #1a222b;
                color: #eda423;
            }
            html.dark .up-thumb-wrap {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #26333f, #1c2a38);
                color: #5f7488;
            }

            /* sidebar markup + styles live in templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig */

            @media (max-width: 860px) {
                .up-dashboard {
                    flex-direction: column;
                }
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>

        {{ include('partials/navbar.html.twig', {
            is_logged_in: true,
            is_host: is_host ?? false,
            nav_avatar: nav_avatar ?? null,
            notification_count: notification_count ?? 0,
            current_page: 'bookings'
        }) }}

        <main class="up-dashboard">

            <!-- ==================================================
                 SIDEBAR — shared partial (templates/partials/sidebar.html.twig)
                 highlight = active_sidebar key · collapse JS stays on this page
            =================================================== -->
            {% include 'partials/sidebar.html.twig' with { active_sidebar: 'bookings' } %}

            <div class="up-content">

                <section class="up-card up-bookings-card up-reveal">

                    <div class="up-card-header">
                        <h3>My Bookings (<span class="up-wishlist-count">{{ bookings_total }}</span>)</h3>
                        <a href="/" class="up-link-view-all">Browse Listings</a>
                    </div>

                    <!-- STATUS TABS -->
                    <div class="ub-tabs">
                        {% for key, label in tabs %}
                            <a
                                href="{{ path('app_bookings', { status: key }) }}"
                                class="ub-tab{{ status_filter == key ? ' active' : '' }}"
                            >
                                {{ label }}
                                <span class="ub-tab-count">({{ status_counts[key] }})</span>
                            </a>
                        {% endfor %}
                    </div>

                    {% if bookings is empty %}

                        <div class="up-bookings-empty">
                            <i data-lucide="calendar-check"></i>
                            <p class="up-bookings-empty-title">
                                {% if status_filter == 'all' %}
                                    No bookings yet
                                {% else %}
                                    No {{ tabs[status_filter] }} bookings
                                {% endif %}
                            </p>
                            <p class="up-bookings-empty-text">
                                {% if status_filter == 'all' %}
                                    Once you book a stay, it will show up here.
                                {% else %}
                                    Try a different tab, or browse listings to book a new stay.
                                {% endif %}
                            </p>
                            <a href="/" class="up-btn-outline">BROWSE LISTINGS</a>
                        </div>

                    {% else %}

                        <div class="ub-list" style="display:flex; flex-direction:column;">
                            {% for b in bookings %}
                                <a
                                    href="/booking/{{ b.id }}"
                                    class="up-booking-row up-reveal"
                                    style="--i: {{ min(loop.index0, 6) }}"
                                >
                                    <div class="up-booking-thumb up-thumb-wrap">
                                        {% if b.cover %}
                                            <img
                                                src="{{ b.cover_url }}"
                                                alt="{{ b.title }}"
                                                onerror="this.remove();"
                                            >
                                        {% endif %}
                                        <i data-lucide="home"></i>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="up-booking-info">
                                        <h4>{{ b.title }}</h4>
                                        <p class="up-booking-location">{{ b.location }}</p>
                                        <p class="up-booking-dates"><i data-lucide="calendar"></i>{{ b.dates }}</p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="up-booking-side">
                                        <span class="up-status up-status-{{ b.status }}">{{ b.status|capitalize }}</span>

                                        {% if b.show_refund %}
                                            <strong class="ub-refund-amount">₱ {{ b.refunded_fmt }}</strong>
                                            <span>Refunded to Wallet</span>
                                            <span class="ub-refund-note">✓ Credited</span>
                                        {% elseif b.payment_state == 'full' %}
                                            <strong>₱ {{ b.total_fmt }}</strong>
                                            <span>Fully Paid</span>
                                        {% elseif b.payment_state == 'advance' %}
                                            <strong>₱ {{ b.paid_fmt }}</strong>
                                            <span>Reserve Paid</span>
                                            <span class="ub-left-note">₱{{ b.left_fmt }} left</span>
                                        {% else %}
                                            <strong>₱ {{ b.total_fmt }}</strong>
                                            <span>Booking Total</span>
                                        {% endif %}

                                        {% if b.status == 'pending' %}
                                            <button
                                                type="button"
                                                class="ub-cancel-btn"
                                                data-booking-id="{{ b.id }}"
                                            >Cancel</button>
                                        {% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="up-booking-chevron">›</span>
                                </a>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </div>

                    {% endif %}
                </section>

            </div>
        </main>

        {{ include('partials/footer.html.twig') }}

        <!-- Lucide — guarded loader, same key as navbar (never double-runs) -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                "use strict";
                function renderRhIcons() {
                    if (window.lucide && typeof window.lucide.createIcons === "function") {
                        window.lucide.createIcons();
                    }
                }
                if (!window.__rhNavbarLucide) {
                    window.__rhNavbarLucide = true;
                    var s = document.createElement("script");
                    s.src = "https://unpkg.com/lucide@0.469.0/dist/umd/lucide.min.js";
                    s.addEventListener("load", renderRhIcons);
                    document.head.appendChild(s);
                }
                if (document.readyState === "loading") {
                    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", renderRhIcons);
                } else {
                    renderRhIcons();
                }
                window.addEventListener("load", renderRhIcons);
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- Sidebar collapse — same behavior + localStorage key as legacy -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                var sidebar = document.getElementById("upSidebar");
                var toggle = document.getElementById("upSidebarToggle");
                if (!sidebar || !toggle) {
                    return;
                }

                var STORAGE_KEY = "roomhive_sidebar_collapsed";
                var links = sidebar.querySelectorAll(".up-side-link");

                function updateTitles(collapsed) {
                    links.forEach(function (link) {
                        var label = link.querySelector(".up-side-label");
                        if (collapsed) {
                            link.setAttribute("title", label ? label.textContent : "");
                        } else {
                            link.removeAttribute("title");
                        }
                    });
                }

                function applyState(collapsed) {
                    sidebar.classList.toggle("collapsed", collapsed);
                    toggle.setAttribute("aria-expanded", collapsed ? "false" : "true");
                    toggle.setAttribute(
                        "aria-label",
                        collapsed ? "Expand sidebar" : "Collapse sidebar",
                    );
                    updateTitles(collapsed);
                }

                var savedCollapsed = false;
                try {
                    savedCollapsed = localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY) === "1";
                } catch (e) {}
                applyState(savedCollapsed);

                toggle.addEventListener("click", function () {
                    var nowCollapsed = !sidebar.classList.contains("collapsed");
                    applyState(nowCollapsed);
                    try {
                        localStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, nowCollapsed ? "1" : "0");
                    } catch (e) {}
                });
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- CANCEL BOOKING — pending rows only. The confirm wording is
     the details page's; the hidden-form POST is followed by the
     controller's PRG redirect (/booking/{id}?review=1), so the
     "rate your stay" box pops the moment the cancellation lands. -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                "use strict";

                var CONFIRM_TEXT =
                    "Cancel this booking? Your paid reserve will be refunded to your wallet.";

                document.querySelectorAll(".ub-cancel-btn").forEach(function (btn) {
                    btn.addEventListener("click", function (e) {
                        /* the button sits inside the row <a> — stop the
                           navigation, then own the click */
                        e.preventDefault();
                        e.stopPropagation();

                        if (!window.confirm(CONFIRM_TEXT)) {
                            return;
                        }

                        var bookingId = btn.getAttribute("data-booking-id");
                        if (!bookingId) {
                            return;
                        }

                        btn.disabled = true;

                        /* plain form POST — the browser follows the
                           controller's redirect, no fetch fallback needed */
                        var form = document.createElement("form");
                        form.method = "POST";
                        form.action = "/booking/cancel-booking";

                        var input = document.createElement("input");
                        input.type = "hidden";
                        input.name = "booking_id";
                        input.value = bookingId;

                        form.appendChild(input);
                        document.body.appendChild(form);
                        form.submit();
                    });
                });
            })();
        </script>

        <!-- Reveal — the REAL legacy mechanism: myaccount.css waits for .in-view.
     Plus a 1.5s failsafe so the page can never render blank. -->
        <script>
            (function () {
                "use strict";

                var reduced = window.matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;
                var revealEls = Array.prototype.slice.call(
                    document.querySelectorAll(".up-reveal"),
                );

                function showAll() {
                    revealEls.forEach(function (el) {
                        el.classList.add("in-view");
                    });
                }

                if (reduced || !("IntersectionObserver" in window)) {
                    showAll();
                } else {
                    var io = new IntersectionObserver(
                        function (entries) {
                            entries.forEach(function (entry) {
                                if (!entry.isIntersecting) {
                                    return;
                                }
                                var el = entry.target;
                                io.unobserve(el);
                                el.classList.add("in-view");
                                window.setTimeout(function () {
                                    el.style.setProperty("--i", "0");
                                }, 1200);
                            });
                        },
                        {
                            threshold: 0.12,
                            rootMargin: "0px 0px -40px 0px",
                        },
                    );
                    revealEls.forEach(function (el) {
                        io.observe(el);
                    });

                    /* failsafe — force-reveal anything still hidden after 1.5s */
                    setTimeout(showAll, 1500);
                }
            })();
        </script>

    </body>
</html>
